{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38874","headline":"献长沙王侍郎 · 杜荀鹤","name":"献长沙王侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文星渐见射台星，皆仰爲霖沃衆情。\n天泽逼来逢圣主，辞林盛去得书生。\n云粧岳色供吟景，月浩湘流递政声。\n美化事多难讽诵，未如耕钓口分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}